{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-4","storyName":"赤雪之兆","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"小队被隔开。梓兰和空爆战胜拦路的野兽，另一边，宝巫迦也击败了“异兽”，然而，倒下的“异兽”竟再次站了起来......","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["空爆","政宗","梓兰","宝巫迦","“异兽”熔火蜗"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"dialog","id":9},{"type":"image","id":10},{"type":"charslot","id":11},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_bg_71_g5_snowymountpath.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“兔团子”还真不赖，吃完感觉身上暖洋洋的，充满了力量！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$7","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"那是当然的喵！“兔团子”不仅能填饱肚子，不同的口味还能给猎人带来各种神奇的效果喵！","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"总觉得......有种不好的预感。这里的空气，让人很不舒服。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是“诅咒”的气息，而且越来越浓郁了。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"咦？你们有没有觉得......好像没那么冷了？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不是错觉。你看脚下！","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"众人低头看去，只见脚下厚厚的积雪正在以肉眼可见的速度融化，露出其下黑色的火山岩。","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"周围的空气迅速变得灼热、干燥，甚至开始弥漫起一股硫磺的味道。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这是怎么回事喵？！雪山怎么变成火山了喵？！","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是“异兽”的“诅咒”......它在凭借自己的力量，将这里的环境改造成更适合它自己的战场！","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":42},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"4","ystrength":"4","vibrato":"20","randomness":"30","fadeout":"true","id":43},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":44},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":45,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"远处的雪峰上，一道火光冲天而起，紧接着，滚烫的岩浆从山顶流淌而下，将白色的雪地染成一片触目惊心的赤红。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哇啊啊！真的喷发了！","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾能感觉到，雪山之中有一股正在酝酿的巨大能量......一定是熔火蜗，它想要用“诅咒”的力量将整座雪山改造成火山！","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不，不对......“诅咒”的能量不止一处......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"有两个不同的能量点，雪山之中的那个最为巨大！","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你说什么？！","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"必须去阻止它！","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","loop":"false","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.3","id":63},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":64},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":66},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","id":67},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"突然，他们脚下的地面裂开一道巨大的缝隙，灼热的岩浆从地缝中喷涌而出，瞬间隔断了队伍。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"梓兰小姐！空爆小姐！","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐！宝巫迦她——","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"啧，居然来这一手......","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"翔虫——可恶，这些岩浆太碍事了，翔虫也飞不过去！","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"唔......只能如此了。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"两位，吾去解决雪山之中的那个能量点，你们只要想办法自保就好！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦，等等！","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"啧，这孩子怎么这么喜欢一个人把事情揽下来！","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"那么，正好喵。","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"就让我们看看你们的修行成果吧喵。义经，我们退后喵。","id":102},{"type":"dialog","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":105},{"type":"text","text":"义经发出一声低沉的吼声，像是在说“别让我们失望”。","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"欸？你们不上吗？","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这是属于你们的第一次考验，是检验你们是否有资格被称为猎人的考试喵！","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，准备好了吗？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿，当然！","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我用曲射限制它的走位，你找机会给它的腿来一下！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"了解！看我用变形斩突进！","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowrun","volume":"1","id":122},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_start","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_attack1","id":127},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_weapon01","id":130},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"120.1","y":"-103.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":131},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":132},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_daoguang_blue","x":"-1","y":"8.3","rox":"78","roy":"-50","roz":"-112","yScale":"1","layer":"1","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":135},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_shieldattack","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_attack4","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_power1","id":141},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_ground","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_weapon02","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":145},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":146},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_daoguang_blue","x":"-102.4","y":"141","rox":"171.3","roy":"-56.68","roz":"24.9","layer":"1","id":147},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"-90.1","y":"80.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":148},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_arrow_skyattack","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"0","xstrength":"20","vibrato":"40","randomness":"30","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_arrow_attack","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_hit","volume":"1","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":163},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"-170.1","y":"-123.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":164},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":166},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_arrow_skyattack","volume":"1","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":168},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_arrow_attack","volume":"1","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_hit","volume":"1","id":170},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"-170.1","y":"-123.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":173},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"哦？梓兰的判断很准确喵，先破坏后足能让它倒地喵。","id":178},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice2","volume":"0.8","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"义经发出一声短促、尖锐的叫声，像是在提醒什么。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"嗯？义经在问，梓兰你为什么一直在拉开距离喵？你的箭很准，但你好像在下意识地回避近身的危险喵。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"（被看穿了吗......）","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐！它要用那招喷火了！就是现在！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，躲开！那招不能硬接！它的威力太大了！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不！我要试试！指南上说，最强的盾斧，就是要迎接最强的攻击！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"你这家伙！别乱来喵！","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"（这个笨蛋，居然真的主动去接熔岩炮喵！）","id":202},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_insect","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":210},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","volume":"0.3","id":212},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","volume":"0.3","id":213},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","id":214},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_guardhit1","volume":"1","channel":"guard","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":216},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.4","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_hyper","volume":"1","channel":"hyper","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":219},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.4","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":223},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":224},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"呜哇！好烫！成功了......","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"multiline","name":"空爆","text":"但是......身体好麻......","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你受伤了！快退后！","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"才不呢！看我用这个终结它！","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"她要干什么喵？！熔火蜗也要反击了！她要和它同归于尽吗喵？！","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"超高输出属性解放斩！","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"charslot","id":240},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":241},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"60","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":243},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_electric","volume":"1","channel":"elec","id":246},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_chainsaw_start","volume":"1","channel":"start","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_chainsaw","volume":"1","channel":"chao","id":250},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_shieldattack","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"chao","fadetime":"0.5","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":257},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_daoguang_blue","x":"-4","y":"2","roz":"-140","layer":"1","id":258},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.7","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"60","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":259},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"-90.1","y":"-180.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_weapon03","volume":"1","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":265},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":266},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst1","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":270},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_lighting","layer":"1","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":272},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":273},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst2","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":277},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":278},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":280},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_burst","volume":"1","channel":"burst3","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_smoke","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":285},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":292},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿，梓兰姐，你看到了吗！","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你——","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"糟了......感觉身体好轻——","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉，笨蛋。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":304},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"0.7","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":313},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_71_i03.png","fxScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","adetime":"0","id":314},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":317},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"charslot","id":319},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.5","id":320,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"篝火在一旁噼啪作响，驱散着寒意。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰正蹲在地上，仔细地处理着空爆身上的伤口，她的眉头紧锁。","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿嘿。梓兰姐，我刚才可帅了！熔火蜗虽然也很厉害，但是——","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"charslot","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰手上的动作加重了一分。","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"疼疼疼，梓兰姐，轻点。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"唉，我就知道，你拿上这把武器，就多半会变成这样子。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"是——嘶，好疼！但是，梓兰姐，你不觉得很有趣吗？狩猎真是太好玩了。","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你这一身伤，我是看不出有什么好玩的。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"就是那种......拼尽全力，用智慧和勇气战胜比自己强大无数倍的对手的感觉！","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我可不想懂。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我只看到你为了所谓的“帅气”，连我的命令都不听了。","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我那不是不听命令啦！我......","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"义经说得没错。","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"欸？义经说什么了来着？","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"他说我一直在下意识地回避近身战斗。他说对了。","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但你呢，空爆？政宗也说你太乱来了。你难道就不觉得自己刚才是在用自己的命去赌吗？","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我......","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（政宗也说我乱来......但是，不那么做的话，就感觉......就感觉抓不住那一瞬间的机会......）","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（那种心脏快要跳出来的感觉，那种把一切都赌在那一瞬间的感觉......）","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"......","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我真搞不懂，对你来说，狩猎到底是什么。","id":343},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"空爆闻言歪了歪头，她想要和平常一样找点俏皮话回答，但话到了嘴边，不知道为什么，忽然说不出口了。","id":346},{"type":"text","text":"沉默在两人之间盘桓，只有一边的烤肉架发出的滋滋声证明着时间的流逝。","id":347},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":349},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"image","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_bg_71_g5_snowymountpath.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":358},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":359,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":362},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":363},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"50","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","volume":"1","id":367},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"原来如此，这一代的“异兽”，居然是一只如此巨大的熔火蜗。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"先奴役了一只普通的熔火蜗，凭借“诅咒”想要将整座雪山改造成火山，改造成更适合你们生存的地方。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"然后，将吾等分散，想要各个击破。","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"不过，你犯了两个错误......","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"第一，你没有意识到，梓兰小姐和空爆小姐很强。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是啊，你自己也应该感觉到了，“诅咒”的力度已经减弱了许多，那个比你弱小的“诅咒”源已经消失了。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"她们已经消灭了你的手下吧。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"而第二个错误——就是成为吾的对手。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"受死吧。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"charslot","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.4","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_heavy","volume":"0.9","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bone_rub","volume":"0.9","id":393},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“异兽”熔火蜗","text":"（虚弱的吼叫）","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2104_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":399},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"0.7","id":400},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"......","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":405},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_bg_71_g5_snowymountpath.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":415,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"唔——","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"发生了什么？！","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"charslot","id":421},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦感到，在她的脚下，在更深更远的地下，有什么东西正在吸引着她。","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"这股吸力过于强大，以至于她感到自己的灵魂正被抽离出身体。","id":423},{"type":"text","text":"巨大的痛苦填满了她，让她连呼吸都有些困难。","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"同时，已经倒在地上的“异兽”熔火蜗尸体忽然爆发出冲天的黑气，伴随着黑气的逐渐旺盛，它居然缓缓地从地上爬了起来。","id":425},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":427},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":428},{"type":"text","text":"它的壳逐渐裂开，露出其下的真容——那物质没有形状可言，也难以描述其性质，仅仅只是一块被撕裂的空间而已。","id":429},{"type":"text","text":"但是，却又切实地存在于异兽的背上。","id":430},{"type":"dialog","id":431},{"type":"charslot","id":432},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"60","ystrength":"60","vibrato":"70","randomness":"80","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":433},{"type":"playsound","key":"$grenade_explosion","volume":"1","id":434},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","id":435},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.2","block":"true","id":436},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":438},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"咕——","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"它的进攻比刚才凶猛了好几倍......","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2104_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“异兽”熔火蜗","text":"（愤怒的吼叫）","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2104_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"charslot","id":447},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":448},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","loop":"false","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.3","id":449},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":450},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":451},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":452},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","id":453},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":454},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_bg_71_g6_lavacaverns.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":455},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"居然将周围的环境彻底改变成了火山......","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":459},{"type":"charslot","id":460},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":461},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","loop":"false","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.3","id":462},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":463},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":464},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":465},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","id":466},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"4","ystrength":"4","vibrato":"20","randomness":"30","fadeout":"true","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":468},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"它要干什么......","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"难道它想要引发火山爆发？！","id":472,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"决不能让它得逞！","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":475},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":476},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":477},{"type":"bgeffect","id":478},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":479},{"type":"image","id":480},{"type":"charslot","id":481}],"characters":["空爆","政宗","梓兰","宝巫迦","“异兽”熔火蜗"]}